{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29191","headline":"郊园秋日寄洛中友人 · 许浑","name":"郊园秋日寄洛中友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚水西来天际流，感时伤别思悠悠。\n一尊酒尽青山莫，万里书回碧树秋。\n日落远波惊宿鴈，风吹轻浪起眠鸥。\n嵩阳亲友如相问，潘岳闲居欲白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}